{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-dialog",
  "category": "layout",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-dialog&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "description": "Documentación y demos del componente iswc-dialog de InSoft.",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-dialog",
  "loads": ["iswc-slots-pg"],
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Modal accesible que requiere la atención inmediata del usuario. Equivalente",
        "          a <code class=\"code\">&lt;dialog&gt;</code> nativo, con header, footer, animaciones,",
        "          light-dismiss y API declarativa <code class=\"code\">data-dialog=\"close\"</code>."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openStandard\">Abrir diálogo</iswc-button>",
          "equivNote": "light-dismiss y cancelación de iswc-hide controlan el cierre.",
          "equivHtml": "<!-- ver diagrama de ramas -->",
          "equivFlow": [
            "<iswc-flowchart open-on-click animation=\"flow\">",
            "  <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "  {",
            "    \"flowchart\": {",
            "      \"title\": \"iswc-dialog: cierre\",",
            "      \"direction\": \"TB\",",
            "      \"nodes\": [",
            "        {",
            "          \"id\": \"q\",",
            "          \"label\": \"light-dismiss?\",",
            "          \"shape\": \"diamond\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"id\": \"a\",",
            "          \"label\": \"clic fuera → hide\",",
            "          \"shape\": \"round\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"id\": \"b\",",
            "          \"label\": \"solo X / Escape\",",
            "          \"shape\": \"round\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"id\": \"c\",",
            "          \"label\": \"iswc-hide cancelado?\",",
            "          \"shape\": \"diamond\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"id\": \"d\",",
            "          \"label\": \"pulse / no cierra\",",
            "          \"shape\": \"stadium\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"id\": \"e\",",
            "          \"label\": \"cierra\",",
            "          \"shape\": \"stadium\"",
            "        }",
            "      ],",
            "      \"edges\": [",
            "        {",
            "          \"from\": \"q\",",
            "          \"to\": \"a\",",
            "          \"label\": \"si\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"from\": \"q\",",
            "          \"to\": \"b\",",
            "          \"label\": \"no\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"from\": \"a\",",
            "          \"to\": \"c\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"from\": \"b\",",
            "          \"to\": \"c\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"from\": \"c\",",
            "          \"to\": \"d\",",
            "          \"label\": \"si\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"from\": \"c\",",
            "          \"to\": \"e\",",
            "          \"label\": \"no\"",
            "        }",
            "      ]",
            "    }",
            "  }",
            "  </script>",
            "</iswc-flowchart>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-dialog id=\"dlgStandard\" label=\"Diálogo estándar\" backdrop-variant=\"basic\">",
            "          <p>Esto es un diálogo estándar. Puedes poner cualquier contenido aquí.</p>",
            "          <div slot=\"footer\">",
            "            <iswc-button data-dialog=\"close\" variant=\"outlined\">Cancelar</iswc-button>",
            "            <iswc-button data-dialog=\"close\" color=\"brand\">Aceptar</iswc-button>",
            "          </div>",
            "        </iswc-dialog>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "no-header",
      "title": "Sin header",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">without-header</code> oculta el header y el botón de cerrar.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openNoHeader\">Abrir sin header</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-dialog id=\"dlgNoHeader\" without-header>",
            "          <p>¡Mira mamá, sin header! A veces solo necesitas un diálogo limpio y simple.</p>",
            "          <div slot=\"footer\">",
            "            <iswc-button data-dialog=\"close\" variant=\"outlined\">Cerrar</iswc-button>",
            "          </div>",
            "        </iswc-dialog>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "width",
      "title": "Ancho",
      "lede": [
        "Define <code class=\"code\">--width</code> en el host para cambiar el ancho preferido.",
        "          Se reduce automáticamente en pantallas pequeñas."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openWide\">Diálogo ancho</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-dialog id=\"dlgWide\" label=\"Diálogo ancho\" style=\"--width: 800px\">",
            "          <p>Este diálogo es más ancho que el predeterminado, útil cuando necesitas más espacio para el contenido.</p>",
            "          <div slot=\"footer\">",
            "            <iswc-button data-dialog=\"close\" color=\"brand\">Entendido</iswc-button>",
            "          </div>",
            "        </iswc-dialog>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "header-actions",
      "title": "Acciones en el header",
      "lede": [
        "El slot <code class=\"code\">header-actions</code> añade botones a la derecha del título",
        "          (el botón de cerrar va siempre al final)."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openActions\">Abrir</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-dialog id=\"dlgActions\" label=\"Con header-actions\">",
            "          <div slot=\"header-actions\">",
            "            <iswc-button variant=\"plain\" aria-label=\"Maximizar\">",
            "              <iswc-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:arrow-top-right-bottom-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            </iswc-button>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <p>Añade acciones custom al header.</p>",
            "          <div slot=\"footer\">",
            "            <iswc-button data-dialog=\"close\" color=\"brand\">OK</iswc-button>",
            "          </div>",
            "        </iswc-dialog>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "light-dismiss",
      "title": "Light dismiss",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">light-dismiss</code> cierra el diálogo al hacer click fuera.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openLD\">Abrir (click fuera cierra)</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-dialog id=\"dlgLD\" label=\"Light dismiss\" light-dismiss>",
            "          <p>Haz click fuera del diálogo para cerrarlo.</p>",
            "        </iswc-dialog>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prevent-close",
      "title": "Prevenir el cierre",
      "lede": [
        "Cancela el evento <code class=\"code\">iswc-hide</code> con",
        "          <code class=\"code\">event.preventDefault()</code> para impedir el cierre. Si el usuario",
        "          intenta cerrar, el diálogo pulsa brevemente para llamar la atención."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openPrevent\">Diálogo protegido</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-dialog id=\"dlgPrevent\" label=\"¿Salir sin guardar?\">",
            "          <p>Este diálogo solo se cierra con el botón \"Guardar y salir\". Si cierras con Escape o el botón X, el diálogo pulsa brevemente.</p>",
            "          <div slot=\"footer\">",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"btnForceClose\" color=\"brand\">Guardar y salir</iswc-button>",
            "          </div>",
            "        </iswc-dialog>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "form",
      "title": "Diálogo con formulario",
      "lede": "Un caso típico: edición de un registro en un diálogo.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openForm\">Editar perfil</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-dialog id=\"dlgForm\" label=\"Editar perfil\" style=\"--width: 480px\">",
            "          <form id=\"profileForm\" style=\"display:grid;gap:.75em\">",
            "            <label>Nombre",
            "              <iswc-input name=\"name\" required value=\"Jeff Aporta\"></iswc-input>",
            "            </label>",
            "            <label>Email",
            "              <iswc-input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required value=\"jeff@example.com\"></iswc-input>",
            "            </label>",
            "            <label>Bio",
            "              <iswc-input name=\"bio\" value=\"Ingeniero\"></iswc-input>",
            "            </label>",
            "          </form>",
            "          <div slot=\"footer\">",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"btnFormCancel\" data-dialog=\"close\" variant=\"outlined\">Cancelar</iswc-button>",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"btnFormSave\" color=\"brand\">Guardar</iswc-button>",
            "          </div>",
            "        </iswc-dialog>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "slots-pg",
      "title": "Slots Playground",
      "lede": "Estandar W11: dos tabs (Simple + Slots). El tab Slots muestra shadow template, codigo editable y un editor por cada slot detectado del componente.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-slots-pg tag=\"iswc-dialog\">",
            "  <iswc-dialog open label=\"Confirmar\">",
            "    <p>¿Estas seguro de que quieres continuar?</p>",
            "    <iswc-button slot=\"footer\" color=\"brand\">Aceptar</iswc-button>",
            "    <iswc-button slot=\"footer\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"plain\">Cancelar</iswc-button>",
            "  </iswc-dialog>",
            "  <strong slot=\"label\">Confirmar accion</strong>",
            "  <iswc-button slot=\"header-actions\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"plain\" pill title=\"Ayuda\">",
            "    <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:help-circle-outline\"></iswc-icon>",
            "  </iswc-button>",
            "</iswc-slots-pg>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "slots-pg",
      "title": "Slots Playground",
      "lede": "Estandar W11: dos tabs (Simple + Slots). El tab Slots muestra shadow template, codigo editable y un editor por cada slot detectado del componente.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-slots-pg tag=\"iswc-dialog\">",
            "  <iswc-dialog open label=\"Confirmar\">",
            "    <p>¿Estas seguro de que quieres continuar?</p>",
            "    <iswc-button slot=\"footer\" color=\"brand\">Aceptar</iswc-button>",
            "    <iswc-button slot=\"footer\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"plain\">Cancelar</iswc-button>",
            "  </iswc-dialog>",
            "  <strong slot=\"label\">Confirmar accion</strong>",
            "  <iswc-button slot=\"header-actions\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"plain\" pill title=\"Ayuda\">",
            "    <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:help-circle-outline\"></iswc-icon>",
            "  </iswc-button>",
            "</iswc-slots-pg>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
